    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the market surveillance authority has made a request under the first sentence`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The AI Office shall take utmost account of the request" (a duty on a request made under the first sentence) (fork F-75-2a-second-sub-duty)

