-- src:1192 | The AI Office shall take utmost account of the request and the market surveillance authority shall cooperate actively and provide the AI Office the necessary assistance for the exercise of its powers in accordance with paragraph 1a.
@ref Art 75(2a) second subparagraph (src:1192)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the market surveillance authority has made a request under the first sentence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75 act`
`Art 75(2a) the market surveillance authority's duty to cooperate actively after the request` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the market surveillance authority has made a request under the first sentence`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
