        MUST `Art 75(2a) cooperate actively with the AI Office and provide the necessary assistance`
        HENCE FULFILLED

-- "without undue delay and in any event no later than four months following receipt of the request": the limit is a period the text fixes in its own words.
-- src:1193 | The AI Office shall, without undue delay and in any event no later than four months following receipt of the request, inform the single point of contact of its intention to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a or of its reasons for not exercising its powers. If the AI Office decides to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a, it shall periodically inform that single point of contact about major developments in the proceedings and the outcome of such proceedings, without disclosing any confidential information.
@ref Art 75(2a) third subparagraph first sentence (src:1193)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the date the AI Office received the request` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Art 75(2a) third subparagraph the latest date by which the AI Office must inform the single point of contact` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE JUST (`add months` `the date the AI Office received the request` 4)  -- "no later than four months following receipt of the request"

-- src:1193 | The AI Office shall, without undue delay and in any event no later than four months following receipt of the request, inform the single point of contact of its intention to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a or of its reasons for not exercising its powers. If the AI Office decides to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a, it shall periodically inform that single point of contact about major developments in the proceedings and the outcome of such proceedings, without disclosing any confidential information.
@ref Art 75(2a) third subparagraph first sentence (src:1193)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the date the AI Office received the request` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75 act`
`Art 75(2a) third subparagraph the AI Office's duty to inform the single point of contact within four months` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Art 75(2a) third subparagraph the latest date by which the AI Office must inform the single point of contact` `the date asked` `the date the AI Office received the request`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked
    WHEN JUST `the deadline` THEN
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        MUST `Art 75(2a) inform the single point of contact of the AI Office's intention to exercise its powers or of its reasons for not exercising them`
        WITHIN (Day `the deadline`) MINUS (Day `the date the AI Office received the request`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office` BECAUSE "the single point of contact was not informed within four months following receipt of the request"

-- src:1193 | The AI Office shall, without undue delay and in any event no later than four months following receipt of the request, inform the single point of contact of its intention to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a or of its reasons for not exercising its powers. If the AI Office decides to exercise its powers in accordance with Article 75a, it shall periodically inform that single point of contact about major developments in the proceedings and the outcome of such proceedings, without disclosing any confidential information.
